 r←{parms}Repack folder;rc;more;buff;cmd;depth;window
⍝ Cleans up and optimises Git's internal storage by consolidating loose objects into packfiles.
⍝ The optional `parms` is `(window depth)`; it defaults to `10 50`.
 parms←{0<⎕NC ⍵:⍎⍵ ⋄ 10 50}'parms'
 (window depth)←2↑parms
 cmd←'repack '
 cmd,←'--depth=',(⍕depth),' '
 cmd,←'--window=',(⍕window),' '
 (rc more buff)←folder U.RunGitCommand cmd
 more U.Assert 0=rc
 r←more
⍝Done
